[486.636643, "o", "244:sent: 2020-01-01\r\n249:sent: 2024-01-01\r\n474:`sent: YYYY-MM-DD`, apply the status change only if sent is greater than or\r\n475:equal to the ledger date for that transaction. When no `sent:` line is present,\r\n1208:that transaction, and that email block includes a `sent:` line. The sent-date\r\n1676:only, compare each qualifying email's `sent:` date against the transaction's\r\n2843:sent: 2024-06-15\r\n3416:sent: 2024-08-15\r\n3841:sent: 2024-08-10\r\n3846:sent: 2024-09-01\r\n"]
